  description="Peer-reviewed publications in immunology, regulatory T cells, flow cytometry, and repertoire sequencing."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Publications</p>
      <h1>Work that made it into the record</h1>
      <p>
        Peer-reviewed contributions across regulatory T-cell biology, repertoire sequencing, and
        cytometry method development, plus ongoing peer review for
        <a href="https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/immunology" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Frontiers in Immunology</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="role-meta">
        ORCID
        <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7002-0187" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">0000-0001-7002-0187</a>
        &middot; {publications.length} publications
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

